{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2021-09-21 11:16:00', 'title': 'MODERNA COVID-19 VACCINE CLINICAL TRIAL FOR PEOPLE WITH ORGAN TRANSPLANT STARTS AT FEINSTEIN INSTITUTES', 'text': 'MANHASSET, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IN A NEW CLINICAL TRIAL LOOKING AT THE EFFICACY OF A THIRD MODERNA VACCINE DOSE FOR CORONAVIRUS DISEASE 2019 (COVID-19) IN PEOPLE LIVING WITH AN ORGAN (LIVER OR KIDNEY) TRANSPLANT, THE FEINSTEIN INSTITUTES FOR MEDICAL RESEARCH – THE SCIENCE ARM OF NORTHWELL HEALTH – ADMINISTERED THE EXTRA VACCINE TO THE FIRST SET OF PATIENTS IN THE UNITED STATES ON SEPTEMBER 20. THE MULTI-CENTERED, NATIONWIDE CLINICAL TRIAL IS SPONSORED BY THE VACCINE-MAKER MODERNA. PEOPLE WHO'}